  "schema:comment": [
    "LiNi0.5Mn1.5O4 (aqueous processed); high Mn/Ni disorder spinel.",
    "8 of the 95 published measurements were made on cells built from this batch.",
    "Active-mass loading: 4.0829 +/- 0.3234 mg/cm2 (mean +/- sample standard deviation, n = 8 cells; range 3.6462-4.4727 mg/cm2), over the per-cell values metadata.csv publishes for this batch.",
    "Dry thickness: 47.0 um. metadata.csv states this one value for every one of the 8 cells of the batch, so the mean is that stated value and the standard deviation is 0 by construction - not a measured spread."
  ],
